WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.487
Priced Out of Our Own Country: The Engineered Housing Crisis.

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:12.762
In 1946, the Veterans Land Act helped returning soldiers buy homes and farmland for a fraction of a year s wages.

00:00:12.762 --> 00:00:19.900
The men who waded through the surf at Juno Beach came home to a country that believed shelter was a right, not a luxury.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:28.712
Today, their grandchildren face average home prices exceeding $680,000 more than ten times the median household income.

00:00:28.712 --> 00:00:37.837
Every number on this page comes from CMHC, Statistics Canada, the Parliamentary Budget Officer, and the Auditor General of Canada.

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:39.975
This is not opinion.

00:00:39.975 --> 00:00:41.900
This is their data.
